OL,3,AMinister backs legal right to job
OL,4,Asupport for young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe work and pensions secretary has
OL,7,Fbacked the idea that the government
OL,8,Fshould legally guarantee young people
OL,9,Fhelp to get into employment.
OL,11,FPat McFadden told the BBC that job
OL,12,Fsupport should be given a "legislative
OL,13,Funderpinning", adding the level of
OL,14,Fassistance on offer was currently
OL,15,F"vague".
OL,17,FMcFadden also confirmed that some
OL,18,Fcurrent benefit claimants would see
OL,19,Ftheir current entitlement to benefits
OL,20,Freduced when they are reassessed.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
